  "lines": [
    {"id":"paper_artisan_start","speaker":"老纸匠","text":"纸先离地，浆先避尘。做这行，急不得。","voice":"zh-CN-YunjianNeural","emotion":"normal","character_params":{"rate":"-7%","pitch":"-10Hz"},"dialog_path":"game/data/dialogs/ch4_resident_v_paper_artisan_daily.tres","node_id":"start"},
    {"id":"paper_artisan_reply","speaker":"老纸匠","text":"买来写家信的，用不着挑最贵的，挑一张落墨匀的就好。","voice":"zh-CN-YunjianNeural","emotion":"normal","character_params":{"rate":"-7%","pitch":"-10Hz"},"dialog_path":"game/data/dialogs/ch4_resident_v_paper_artisan_daily.tres","node_id":"reply"},
    {"id":"market_buyer_start","speaker":"采买妇人","text":"买东西先看分量，别只听吆喝。家里这点盐油，样样都得算着。","voice":"zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural","emotion":"normal","character_params":{"rate":"-3%","pitch":"-4Hz"},"dialog_path":"game/data/dialogs/ch4_resident_v_market_buyer_daily.tres","node_id":"start"},
    {"id":"market_buyer_reply","speaker":"采买妇人","text":"街坊托我捎一把青菜，顺路的事。住得近，总要彼此搭把手。","voice":"zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural","emotion":"normal","character_params":{"rate":"-3%","pitch":"-4Hz"},"dialog_path":"game/data/dialogs/ch4_resident_v_market_buyer_daily.tres","node_id":"reply"},
    {"id":"docks_loader_start","speaker":"装卸伙计","text":"绳子紧不紧，先看一眼再抬。担子落了，伤的都是自己的手脚。","voice":"zh-CN-YunxiNeural","emotion":"normal","character_params":{"rate":"+3%","pitch":"-5Hz"},"dialog_path":"game/data/dialogs/ch4_resident_v_docks_loader_daily.tres","node_id":"start"},
    {"id":"docks_loader_reply","speaker":"装卸伙计","text":"重货两人搭手，轻货也别抢道。水边这点地方，容不得逞能。","voice":"zh-CN-YunxiNeural","emotion":"normal","character_params":{"rate":"+3%","pitch":"-5Hz"},"dialog_path":"game/data/dialogs/ch4_resident_v_docks_loader_daily.tres","node_id":"reply"},
    {"id":"gate_supply_start","speaker":"货担主人","text":"我赶早挑货进城，卖完再把盐油带回村里，一趟路才不白走。","voice":"zh-CN-YunyangNeural","emotion":"normal","character_params":{"rate":"+1%","pitch":"-3Hz"},"dialog_path":"game/data/dialogs/ch4_resident_v_gate_supply_daily.tres","node_id":"start"},
    {"id":"gate_supply_reply","speaker":"货担主人","text":"你先过，我这担子宽。门前让一让，谁都不必干等。","voice":"zh-CN-YunyangNeural","emotion":"normal","character_params":{"rate":"+1%","pitch":"-3Hz"},"dialog_path":"game/data/dialogs/ch4_resident_v_gate_supply_daily.tres","node_id":"reply"}
